{"product":{"id":8071257456809,"title":"Boo-Boo Gel For Kids","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eDr. Nice's Boo-Boo Gel is an all-natural, non-toxic first aid hydrogel specially formulated for kids. Made with just four plant and water-based ingredients, it provides instant soothing relief for minor cuts, scrapes, wounds, chafe, and minor burns — without harsh chemicals or synthetic preservatives.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eUnlike traditional antiseptic creams, Dr. Nice's Boo-Boo Gel forms a protective, breathable hydrogel barrier that promotes natural healing while keeping the skin moist and comfortable. Vegan, cruelty-free, and pharmacist-formulated — safe enough for kids to self-apply.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eEncourages self-care skills in children. Do not use if allergic to any ingredients. Made in the USA.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Dr. Nice's Natural Products","product_type":"Kids \u003e First Aid Gel","created_at":"2024-04-29T23:09:20-05:00","handle":"boo-boo-gel","updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:03-06:00","published_at":"2024-04-29T23:09:20-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"all natural boo boo gel, cuts and scrapes care, Kids, kids scrape treatment, kids wound care, MCF, natural first aid kids, non toxic wound care, pediatric first aid, safe for children skin repair, safe for children to apply, vegan first aid kids","variants":[{"id":44093764042921,"product_id":8071257456809,"title":"Default Title","price":"19.99","sku":"860010672501","position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2024-04-29T23:09:21-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:03-06:00","taxab